    <h1>About reWord Game</h1>

    <p class="lead">reWord Game is a free online word puzzle. Each level shows a jumbled sentence: drag the words to swap them
        until the sentence reads correctly. Some words are locked in place, so plan your swaps. No signup needed, it runs in any browser.</p>

    <p class="lead"><b>Instructions:</b> drag a word left or right to swap it with its neighbour. Words with a dotted underline can move.
        Stuck? Press Hint to highlight a word that is out of place.</p>
</div>
